---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
 title="Advertising and Affiliate Disclosure — Relocation Cost"
 description="How Relocation Cost may earn money, and why advertisers and affiliate partners never 
influence the estimates shown on this site."
>
 <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14">
 <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-600">Disclosure</p>
 <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Advertising and affiliate disclosure</h1>
 <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">Relocation Cost is a free planning tool. This page 
explains how the site may earn money, so you can judge what you read here.</p>
 <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Current status</h2>
 <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">At the time of writing, this site does not contain 
affiliate links or advertisements. If that changes, this page will be updated.</p>
 <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">How the site may earn money</h2>
 <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 leading-7 text-slate-700">
 <li><strong>Affiliate links:</strong> some links to moving, truck-rental or related services may 
earn the site a commission if you buy through them, at no extra cost to you. Every such link will be 
marked as an affiliate link next to the link itself and tagged as sponsored in the page code.</li>
 <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> the site may later display advertisements, which will be 
identifiable as ads.</li>
 </ul>
 <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">What does not change</h2>
 <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-6 leading-7 text-slate-700">
 <li>The calculator's formula and its sources are the same whether or not a provider pays us. They 
are published on the <a class="font-semibold text-sky-700 underline" href="/methodology">methodology 
page</a>.</li>
 <li>Estimates are planning aids, not quotes. We do not adjust them to favor a provider.</li>
 <li>Where a number is an assumption and not a published figure, the site says so.</li>
 </ul>
 <p class="mt-8 leading-7 text-slate-700">Questions about this policy can be sent through the <a 
class="font-semibold text-sky-700 underline" href="/about">about page</a>.</p>
 </article>
</Layout>
